{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_FEACE0C3","title":"Ady talks fishing","entry":"Dlg_FEACE0C3::entry","exit":"Dlg_FEACE0C3::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AC491C73","articyId":"72057619807799638","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Hello my friend! It is good to see you again. How is this weather treating you today. It is good for the fish, no? And what is good for the fish, is good for Boardwalk Ady!","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello my friend! It is good to see you again. How is this weather treating you today. It is good for the fish, no? And what is good for the fish, is good for Boardwalk Ady!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-2050.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22748","byteOffset":16490544,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_3A28818C","articyId":"72057619807799652","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"You know what they say. Without rain, you cannot make...","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You know what they say. Without rain, you cannot make...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-1450.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37586","byteOffset":28557600,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_6F9B5E03","articyId":"72057619807799683","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Now let us discuss more sober matters. Tell me friend, how are you finding the city? I cannot tell if you come from beyond the city gates, or just from another district. But I can spot a fellow outsider when I see one.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now let us discuss more sober matters. Tell me friend, how are you finding the city? I cannot tell if you come from beyond the city gates, or just from another district. But I can spot a fellow outsider when I see one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1625.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37459","byteOffset":28509848,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_B97F16B9","articyId":"72057619807799704","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"This place suits you. But it's like new shoes you must break in. There will be blisters. Pain. Chaffing. Eventually, you'll walk in style. You'll stride around like you own the place.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This place suits you. But it's like new shoes you must break in. There will be blisters. Pain. Chaffing. Eventually, you'll walk in style. You'll stride around like you own the place.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23587","byteOffset":16801696,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_CD708A9C","articyId":"72057619807799727","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"I do! My old home was dangerous, thrilling, wondrous! But... gone. And I shed no tears. Besides, the fishing is too good here. You can really taste the isotopes.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I do! My old home was dangerous, thrilling, wondrous! But... gone. And I shed no tears. Besides, the fishing is too good here. You can really taste the isotopes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2825.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23054","byteOffset":16606640,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_4A7BED8D","articyId":"72057619807799734","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Me? Never! The fish are too good here. You can really taste the isotopes.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me? Never! The fish are too good here. You can really taste the isotopes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2825.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47617","byteOffset":32351488,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_17A7261A","articyId":"72057619807799751","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Of course! Salty or sweet, no matter what flavor is in the flesh of fish, the most important aspect is the isotopes. The tang... it makes your teeth buzz. It would be a poor meal indeed if the fish was inert - without some level of radioactivity.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course! Salty or sweet, no matter what flavor is in the flesh of fish, the most important aspect is the isotopes. The tang... it makes your teeth buzz. It would be a poor meal indeed if the fish was inert - without some level of radioactivity.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46221","byteOffset":31816848,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_E91FE532","articyId":"72057619807799766","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Safe? What in life is worthwhile AND safe?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Safe? What in life is worthwhile AND safe?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18849","byteOffset":15018360,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_C2171EA8","articyId":"72057619807799795","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"The tastiest fish I ever ate was a broad-fin gupper. It glowed in the dark. Good for the fisherman, bad for the fish. I caught him with an extended pneuma-spear at midnight. Went straight through one of his six eyes.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The tastiest fish I ever ate was a broad-fin gupper. It glowed in the dark. Good for the fisherman, bad for the fish. I caught him with an extended pneuma-spear at midnight. Went straight through one of his six eyes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4625.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21501","byteOffset":16020984,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_B79BB156","articyId":"72057619807799819","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Absolutely. The meat was fibrous but sweet like lobster. I ate him with butter and a case of beer as I watched the neon light of the city dance on the waves of the reef. Glorious.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Absolutely. The meat was fibrous but sweet like lobster. I ate him with butter and a case of beer as I watched the neon light of the city dance on the waves of the reef. Glorious.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5525.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18297","byteOffset":14808928,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_6E705BCA","articyId":"72057619807799826","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Ah, my friend! You must find joy in such things. If you tried it, you would not be so negative.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, my friend! You must find joy in such things. If you tried it, you would not be so negative.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":5525.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36846","byteOffset":28282496,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_EF531B19","articyId":"72057619807799855","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Exactly. So I must ask, did you think of a joke to tell me? A fish one?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Exactly. So I must ask, did you think of a joke to tell me? A fish one?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-850.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17438","byteOffset":14485480,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_0176E836","articyId":"72057619807799879","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Please! Go ahead.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please! Go ahead.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-275.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24031","byteOffset":16970488,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_E46D809E","articyId":"72057619807799894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"I do not know! What do you call a fish with no ears?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I do not know! What do you call a fish with no ears?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":325.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30797","byteOffset":19531832,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_CE6E07E6","articyId":"72057619807799923","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"No.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25273","byteOffset":17444264,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_049BF85D","articyId":"72057619807799930","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Not bad.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not bad.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49266","byteOffset":32980104,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_57843F28","articyId":"72057697117143220","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Fish! Always be with the fish. They swim together because they share the experience of being in the water. And, for the skilled fishers among us, they'll share the experience of being in our bellies!","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Fish! Always be with the fish. They swim together because they share the experience of being in the water. And, for the skilled fishers among us, they'll share the experience of being in our bellies!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6125.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33871","byteOffset":20696512,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_565CBB78","articyId":"72057619807799646","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't like the rain.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't like the rain.","TextSheVersion":"I don't like the rain.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't like the rain."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-1750.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29260","byteOffset":18950520,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_ADE413C2","articyId":"72057619807799659","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"A rainbow?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A rainbow?","TextSheVersion":"A rainbow?","TextTheyVersion":"A rainbow?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-1150.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44645","byteOffset":31222464,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_BC8543FE","articyId":"72057619807799668","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't mind the rain.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't mind the rain.","TextSheVersion":"I don't mind the rain.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't mind the rain."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-1750.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20410","byteOffset":15604112,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_7F453C9C","articyId":"72057619807799676","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Puddles?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Puddles?","TextSheVersion":"Puddles?","TextTheyVersion":"Puddles?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-1150.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42647","byteOffset":30461096,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_CE7AC904","articyId":"72057619807799690","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I moved here recently.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I moved here recently.","TextSheVersion":"I moved here recently.","TextTheyVersion":"I moved here recently."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39186","byteOffset":29157080,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_8B4795A7","articyId":"72057619807799697","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm settling in fine.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm settling in fine.","TextSheVersion":"I'm settling in fine.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm settling in fine."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19666","byteOffset":15323632,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_3AD31955","articyId":"72057619807799713","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you feel at home here?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you feel at home here?","TextSheVersion":"Do you feel at home here?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you feel at home here?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29950","byteOffset":19211240,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_C3D6B8E9","articyId":"72057619807799720","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you miss your old home?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you miss your old home?","TextSheVersion":"Do you miss your old home?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you miss your old home?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21896","byteOffset":16171816,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_B38FCD31","articyId":"72057619807799743","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Isotopes?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Isotopes?","TextSheVersion":"Isotopes?","TextTheyVersion":"Isotopes?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3125.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21021","byteOffset":15834576,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_AE5ECF58","articyId":"72057619807799759","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are the fish safe to eat here?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are the fish safe to eat here?","TextSheVersion":"Are the fish safe to eat here?","TextTheyVersion":"Are the fish safe to eat here?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29511","byteOffset":19043272,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_AA5B4B66","articyId":"72057619807799774","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Lots of things!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Lots of things!","TextSheVersion":"Lots of things!","TextTheyVersion":"Lots of things!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25394","byteOffset":17491792,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_05FE8B83","articyId":"72057619807799780